{"id":"vod_sn_37344","vodId":"37344","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"地球少女","name_cn":"地球少女","date":"2001-01-01","year":"2001","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/470920ab23b581acafbdb3b3f25b111f.jpg"},"summary":"一套日本的环保动画，由Bandai Visual制作。 讲述地球失衡之后世界的变化，共有六个部份13集。　　“想要去看海”这个单纯的念头，竟然带给了普通高中女生有吉树奈一项重大的使命。在她与男友大岛时夫一起乘摩托车从神户去海边的途中发生了车祸，生命垂危的树奈突然看到了地球因破坏大自然而惨遭毁灭的景象，原来这就是人类的最终下场。这时一个神秘的美少年克利斯出现在树奈面前，他答应重新赋予树奈生命，条件是消灭魔鬼拉贾，为地球开创新的未来。肩负着拯救地球的重责大任的少女，她将如何改变自己和人类的命运？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:24","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/L7TGsDmSgZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/eWLPNuMcUY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TNZxwqRKyG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/S7jxcHS6jK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/F6JhAhh2Qx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/f0UaEuwnDq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/D60KgVrWhx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/dVTb6jJDX41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hez45ZgydL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/v91nWPNX0W1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KFCr2puQf41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/KReh1vreF71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/rQCT8SBXRk1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:11.932Z"}